    {
      "name": "Position-scoped coach paper",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "coach-panel",
      "description": "Position-scoped coach paper with compact semantic Markdown content.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-coach\" aria-label=\"Chat with your coach\"><h2>Coach</h2><section class=\"ds-position\" aria-label=\"Position after 4. Nc3 Nf6\"><div class=\"ds-context\">4. Nc3 Nf6</div><div class=\"ds-message\"><strong class=\"ds-author\">Coach</strong><div class=\"ds-message-content\"><h3>Candidate moves</h3><p><strong>Develop</strong> a piece, then compare <code>Nf3</code>.</p><ol><li>Check threats.</li><li>Compare candidates.<ul><li>Keep the king safe.</li></ul></li></ol><blockquote><p>Look for forcing moves.</p></blockquote><p><a href=\"https://lichess.org/learn\">Reference</a></p><table><thead><tr><th>Move</th><th>Idea</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Nf3</td><td>Develop</td></tr></tbody></table><pre><code>1. Nf3 Nc6</code></pre></div></div></section></section>",
      "css": ".ds-coach{font-family:'Manrope Variable',sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#243d44);background:var(--paper,#fff);border:1px solid var(--line,#dce4e4);border-radius:12px;overflow:clip}.ds-coach>h2{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.4;margin:0;padding:10px 12px}.ds-position{padding:12px 12px 20px}.ds-context{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#576a70);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#dce4e4)}.ds-message{margin-bottom:10px}.ds-message .ds-author{display:block;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:var(--green,#286352);margin-bottom:3px}.ds-message-content{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-message-content>*{margin-block:0 8px}.ds-message-content>:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.ds-message-content :is(h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6){font-size:1em;font-weight:800;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:normal;text-wrap:wrap}.ds-message-content :is(ul,ol){padding-inline-start:20px}.ds-message-content li+li{margin-top:3px}.ds-message-content li>p{margin-block:4px}.ds-message-content blockquote{margin-inline:0;padding-inline-start:10px;border-inline-start:1px solid var(--line,#dce4e4);color:var(--muted,#576a70)}.ds-message-content code{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:.95em;font-weight:600;background:var(--soft,#e9efed);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;white-space:break-spaces}.ds-message-content pre{padding:8px;background:var(--soft,#e9efed);border-radius:5px;white-space:pre-wrap}.ds-message-content pre code{padding:0}.ds-message-content a[href]{color:var(--green,#286352);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.ds-message-content a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#2d735e);outline-offset:4px}.ds-message-content table{width:100%;table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse}.ds-message-content :is(th,td){border:1px solid var(--line,#dce4e4);padding:4px 6px;text-align:start}.ds-message-content hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#dce4e4)}.ds-message-content blockquote>p{margin:0}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Board material",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "board-frame",
      "description": "Imported brown checker inside the nearly square wood frame; pieces remain Chessground/Cburnett in the app.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-board-frame\"><svg class=\"ds-board\" viewBox=\"0 0 8 8\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Chessboard material sample\"><defs><pattern id=\"ds-checker\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><rect width=\"2\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#f0d9b5\"/><path d=\"M1 0h1v1H1zM0 1h1v1H0z\" fill=\"#000\" opacity=\".2\"/></pattern></defs><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" fill=\"url(#ds-checker)\"/></svg></div>",
      "css": ".ds-board-frame{padding:4px;background:#d6bd99;border-radius:5px;max-width:410px}.ds-board{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;shape-rendering:crispEdges}@media(width < 760px){.ds-board-frame{padding:4px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Current-game history",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "game-history",
      "description": "First/previous/next/latest controls and selected SAN move buttons below the board. Review preserves the live game.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-history\" aria-label=\"Game moves\"><div class=\"ds-history-controls\"><button class=\"ds-history-icon\" aria-label=\"Go to start\" title=\"Go to start\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 5v14m13-14-7 7 7 7\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-history-icon\" aria-label=\"Previous move\" title=\"Previous move\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15 5-7 7 7 7\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-history-icon\" aria-label=\"Next move\" title=\"Next move\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-history-icon\" aria-label=\"Go to latest move\" title=\"Go to latest move\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 5v14M6 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg></button></div><div class=\"ds-move-list\"><button class=\"ds-move ds-selected\" aria-current=\"step\">1. Nf3</button><button class=\"ds-move\">1... Nf6</button><button class=\"ds-move\">2. Ng1</button><button class=\"ds-move\">2... Ng8</button></div></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-history{font-family:'Manrope Variable',sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:start;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;padding:4px;background:var(--paper,#fff);border:1px solid var(--line,#dce4e4);border-radius:6px}.ds-history-controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,32px);flex:none}.ds-history-icon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border:0;border-radius:6px;padding:0;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#576a70);cursor:pointer}.ds-history-icon:hover{background:#e8efed}.ds-move-list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;min-width:0;max-height:100px;overflow-y:auto;position:relative;padding:4px}.ds-move{font-family:'Manrope Variable',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.65;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;padding:5px 7px;min-height:28px;border:0;border-radius:5px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#576a70);cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.ds-history .ds-selected{background:var(--green,#286352);color:var(--paper,#fff)}.ds-move:not(.ds-selected):hover{background:var(--soft,#e9efed)}.ds-history button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#2d735e);outline-offset:4px}.ds-history button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}@media(width < 760px){.ds-history-controls{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,44px)}.ds-history-icon{width:44px;height:44px}.ds-move{min-height:44px}.ds-move-list{max-height:148px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Personal Study Room",
    "overview": "A tournament scoresheet and a conversation share one quiet workspace. Blue-grey surroundings, white work surfaces, deep petrol ink and muted wood leave the board as the largest visual object. Restrained green marks available actions and current state. The first viewport begins with application controls, a compact coach-controlled task heading and subtitle, and the board. Task copy changes with the lesson; it is working content rather than a promotional introduction.\n\nThe interface uses self-hosted Manrope, hairline borders and precise, compact spacing. Styling is ordinary CSS in reset, base, layout and component layers, with imported Chessground board and Cburnett piece styles; there is no styling framework. Functional labels and actual coaching content carry the voice. Prototype and scripted-coach disclosures stay visible where they explain the product's limits.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Board and coach remain the primary working surfaces.",
      "Flat paper panels, petrol text and restrained green actions.",
      "Position-scoped conversation sections keep instructions and follow-ups attached to each move.",
      "Examples use a separate board in a native dialog.",
      "Responsive stacking preserves the move-entry workflow."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The State Green Rule",
        "body": "Green signals actions, coaching identity or current state; it does not decorate large background fields.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Functional Copy Rule",
        "body": "Coach-controlled task headings and subtitles describe the current activity. Keep controls, state, disclosures and coaching content specific; do not add promotional copy, motivational filler or website-style introductions.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Workspace Rule",
        "body": "Reserve ambient elevation and a scrim for dialogs; ordinary panels use borders and tone.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep the coach-set task, board, compact move entry and position-scoped coach feed as the primary workspace.",
      "Do use green for available actions, coaching identity and current state.",
      "Do preserve keyboard focus, visible or accessible labels and reduced-motion behavior.",
      "Do keep move validation, icon-based notation help and rejected input close to entry.",
      "Do keep the selected history move visible and clearly marked, preserve the live game during review, and require Latest before playing.",
      "Do attach follow-ups to their position and reveal each new player or coach message from its beginning.",
      "Do preserve semantic Markdown structure with compact message typography, wrapping code and readable tables.",
      "Do disclose scripted coaching and illustrative data in functional copy.",
      "Do use the existing plain CSS layers and imported Chessground material."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't add promotional copy, motivational filler or website-style introductions; task headings and subtitles are lesson content.",
      "Don't reintroduce opponent metadata, manual New game or individual-game download controls into the practice workspace.",
      "Don't give ordinary paper panels dialog shadows.",
      "Don't replace algebraic move entry with interactive board movement.",
      "Don't let demonstration steps replace or alter the player's game board.",
      "Don't introduce a styling framework or a second visual vocabulary for new screens."
    ]
  }
}
